<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Mbula</book>
  <para style="h">1 Bitǝrus</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Bit</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Bitǝrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Bitǝrus</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cautera mǝdǝmbe mala</para>
  <para style="mt1">BITƏRUS</para>
  <para style="imt">Mǝncau</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Cautera mǝdǝmbe mala Bitǝrus</char> ka à gilǝì aban kà a ban amǝkwaɗi, mǝnana à tunǝia akani ama &lt;&lt;Aɓwana mala Ɓakuli mǝnana tària&gt;&gt; ka, yià mǝnana à mesǝkea aɓa njenza mala nzali Asiya Mǝkyauwe ka. Tǝ́r gilǝ mǝnia yì cauterǝa ka nda ace ɓakɓabum amǝ ɓallè, mǝnana à nda aɓa kum patanni andǝ kārǝkiban ace paɓamuru malea ka. Aɓa cau mala mǝgilǝgir mǝnia ka, nda rǝ kasǝɓalǝ amǝ ɓallè arǝ Cau Amsǝban mala Yesu Kǝrǝsti, mǝnana lú male, andǝ loapi ɓembe male, andǝ pacau mala nyare male a bania ka, kǝ pea wia tsǝkɓalǝu. Aɓa sǝlǝe mǝno anggo ka, à kǝ earce ama yià ka ɓǝà ak tanni mǝnana à nda aɓalǝi ka nǝ gandǝrǝu, &lt;&lt;kǝla mǝnana Kǝrǝsti gbal ka, nu tanni ace sǝm sǝ nyingga sǝmi kǝla girkani, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm twal kusǝì ka&gt;&gt;; sǝ ɓǝà dumnǝ sǝlǝe kàngkàng ama amǝno yì akārǝkiban ngga à nda ace mwam came mǝɓafoe mala paɓamuru malea, sǝ ɗǝm ngga à nǝ̀ yià kum tangnakusǝia &lt;&lt;a Pwari mǝnana Yesu Kǝrǝsti nǝ̀ lǝmdǝna rǝì nǝi a ban ɓwapǝndǝa kat ka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="ip">Atà mǝnia yì ɓakɓabum a pwari mala tanni ka, mǝgilǝgir ɗǝm ngga kǝ kwarkir amǝ ɓal mǝnia yì cau ka ɓǝà do kǝla aɓwana mǝnana a mala Kǝrǝsti na ka.</para>
  <para style="iot">Agir mǝnana aɓalǝi ka</para>
  <para style="io1">Mǝncau<char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kasǝɓalǝu arǝ amsǝban mala Ɓakuli<char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwarkiru mǝcandǝe arǝ dukdo mǝfele<char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1:13--2:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Atúró mǝnana à nda a ɓabu amǝkwaɗi à nǝ̀ pè ɓǝ̀ tanni yiu ka<char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11--4:19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nongsǝmúrû mala mǝkwaɗi andǝ túró mǝnana nǝ̀ pa ace aɓwana ka<char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masǝlǝata cau<char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Mǝnia yì cauterǝa ka, pur nǝ́ bu Bitǝrus, mǝ'mishan mala Yesu Kǝrǝsti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Aban ká a ban aɓwana mala Ɓakuli mǝnana à tària ka, yia amǝnana à mesǝke, à do kǝla abǝri arǝ abu-nzali mala amǝ Pwantus, andǝ Galati, andǝ Kapadosiya, andǝ bu-nzali Asiya, andǝ bu-nzali Bitiniya ka. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Ɓakuli Tárrú aɓa kàné male ka tàr wun ɗiɗyal ɓǝ̀ wu duk aɓwana male nǝ́ túró mala Bangŋo ace okî Yesu Kǝrǝsti, andǝ kum lakban aɓa nkila male.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lakban aɓa nkila male </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;watsǝkiban nǝ nkila male.&gt;&gt; Kǝla mǝnana à pang nǝ amǝ Isǝrayila aɓa Puro 24:3-8 ka, à watsǝkia wia nkila mala lo-jamnda amúrià ace lǝmdǝ ama à nǝ̀ dum nǝ mǝsǝcau arǝ kùrcau malea andǝa Ɓakuli. Bitǝrus bang ama nkila mala Yesu nda tsǝkiyi kùrcau mala Ɓakuli andǝ aɓwana male ɓǝ̀ tita túró ka (Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 9:18-21">Ib 9:18-21</ref></char>).</note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Ɓǝ̀ Ɓakuli hatǝki wun nǝ ɓwamuru andǝ dorǝpwala.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsǝkɓalǝu arǝ yilǝmu mana <optbreak /> málá male pà kàm raka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ɓwangsǝban kat ka, ɓǝà pè Ɓakuli, Tár Mǝtala sǝm Yesu Kǝrǝsti! Ace mǝsǝswatǝr male mǝgule ka yina nǝ sǝm aɓa bǝsa ɓǝlban. Sǝm kum mǝnia yì bǝsa ɓǝlban acemǝnana Ɓakuli loasǝ Yesu Kǝrǝsti a ɓembe ka. Ado ka sǝm ndanǝ do tsǝkɓalǝu mǝyilǝmui,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 3:5">Tit 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:5">Afi 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:9">2Tim 1:9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />andǝ kum liɓala mǝnana pà nǝ̀ kìɗìkí ko nǝ̀ è, nǝ̀ mal raka; liɓala mǝnana à tsǝ̀ngŋǝ́nà wuni kano a kùli ka. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Sǝ atàcau mala paɓamuru ma'wun ngga, Ɓakuli nda rǝ yál wun nǝ rǝcandǝa male ace kum amsǝban mǝnana gilǝkini nǝ̀ yia lǝmdǝí a masǝlǝata apwari ka. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Mǝnia ka kǝ pa wun banɓoarnado kǝ̀rkǝ́r, kat andǝ amani ama adyan aɓa bu-pwari bǝti ka, dumǝna ama wun nǝ̀ kutio aɓa bumkiɗikea atàcau mala akārǝkiban ɗàngɗáng. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Amǝnia yì akārǝkiban ngga, à nda à nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ama paɓamuru ma'wun ngga, mǝɓafoe na ka. Ko nggearǝ zǝnariya mǝnana kǝ kiɗiki ka, à kǝ mwami nǝ bǝsa; anggo gbal, paɓamuru ma'wun mǝnana doɓoaro male kútì mala zǝnariya ka, dumǝna púp à nǝ̀ mwami, ace mǝnana ɓǝà sǝn came male aɓa mǝkwane ka. Anggo ka sǝ wun nǝ̀ kum ɓwangsǝban, andǝ ɓoarɓwa, andǝ gusǝlǝban a ban Ɓakuli, a Pwari mǝnana Yesu Kǝrǝsti nǝ̀ lǝmdǝna rǝì nǝi a ban ɓwapǝndǝa kat ka. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Kat andǝ amani ama wu malaká sǝni àkǝ̀ pwari raka, wu kǝ earce; sǝ kat andǝ amani ama wu kǝ sǝni ado raka, wu earnǝi, sǝ wu kǝ pak banɓoarnado kǝ̀rkǝ́r, ulang mǝnana gulo male ka mburkun pa nǝ̀ gandǝ bangŋe raka. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Wu ndanǝ ulang man yì banɓoarnado ka acemǝnana wu nda rǝ kum tangnakusǝu mala paɓamuru ma'wun a baní, yi amsǝban mala ayilǝmi wun.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Mǝnia yì amsǝban ngga, amǝ'ɓangnǝa mala Ɓakuli sǝngi pepe sǝ à bǝlkusǝi ɓukɓuk à nǝ̀ súrǝ̀ kǝgìr amurí, sǝ à bang cau mala ɓwamuru mana Ɓakuli nǝ̀ yia lǝmdǝa wun ngga. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />À alte à nǝ̀ súrǝ̀ pwari mǝnana Bangŋo mala Kǝrǝsti mana aɓalǝia nakiyicau amurí ka. Bangŋo mala Kǝrǝsti ak dǝmba lǝmdǝia wia, atanni mǝnana Kǝrǝsti nǝ̀ yia nu sǝ nǝ̀ kutia ɓoarɓwa male ka, sǝ lang sǝ mǝnia yì gìr ka nǝ̀ yia pǎ. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Ɓakuli lǝmdǝì amǝnia yì amǝ'ɓangnǝa male ka ama acau mǝno banggiyi nǝ kunia ka, à pà ace ɓamuria ɗàng, à nda ace wun. Sǝ adyan ngga, mǝnia yì Cau Mǝɓoarne ka, à hamǝna nǝi a banfana a ban wun. Aɓwana mǝnana à hamnǝi ka, à hamnǝi aɓa rǝcandǝa mala Bangŋo Mǝfele mǝnana Ɓakuli tasǝi nǝ kuli ka. Nggearǝ amǝturonjar mala Ɓakuli ka, à tsǝk mǝsǝia à nǝ̀ sǝni lang sǝ amǝnia yì agir ka, à nǝ̀ pa.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tunǝban ace do mǝfele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Ace mani ka, wu nyesǝ aɗenyicau ma'wun a ban mǝ'mwashati aɓa gilǝrǝu ace pak túró. Wu hamí rǝ wun. Wu soa mǝsǝ wun nǝ tsǝk ɓabum wun kat arǝ ɓwamuru mǝnana à nǝ̀ yinǝi a ban wun, a pwari mǝnana à nǝ̀ lǝmdǝì ɓanza rǝ Yesu Kǝrǝsti ka. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ado mǝnana wu nda ka muna mala Ɓakuli amǝ okiru ka, wu kǝa eare ɓǝ̀ do ma'wun duk mala kpata anpel mǝɓane mǝnana wu ndanǝia ɗiɗyal aɓa ɗwanyi sǝlǝe ka ɗàng. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Wu duk do mǝfele aɓa koya gìr wun nǝ̀ pak ka, kǝla mǝnana Ɓakuli mana tàrki wun ngga mǝfele na ka. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Acemǝnana Malǝmce bang ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:16">&lt;&lt;Wu duk do mǝfele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:16">acemana Mǝ nda mǝfele.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Pǝris 11:44</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 11:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:7">20:7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 10:10">10:10</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:40">Ɓal 15:40</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Wu ɗenyi ama, Tárrú mǝnana a kùli, wu pakkiyi hiwi a baní ka, kǝ lǝmdǝ tàrban ɗang. Yì ka, nǝ̀ kasǝi ɓwa ɓashi, ko nǝ̀ pè wi tangnakusǝi mǝnana karǝ arǝ gir mǝnana pè ka. Ace mani ka, wu masǝlǝ do yilǝmu ma'wun kǝla abǝri akani a ɓanza, nǝ ɓanggi Ɓakuli. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Wu sǝlǝna ama, gǝna mǝnana Ɓakuli mbwe ace akmúr wun aɓa do kiɗìkì mǝnana wu kùmô a bu aká wun ngga, pà nǝ́ agir mǝnana à kǝ̀ kiɗikì, kǝla azǝrfa ko zǝnariya ka ɗàng. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Nda nǝ nkila mǝɓoarne mala Kǝrǝsti, Mǝgam mala Ɓakuli, mǝnana cauɓikea ko kǝgìr mǝɓane pa arǝì raka. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Kaniama à nǝ̀ kwakita ɓanza ka, Ɓakuli tarì, tsǝì male ɗàng. Sǝ aɓa mǝnia yì masǝlǝata apwari ka, à yì lǝmdǝni a banfana àkǝ̀ ace wun. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Nǝ́ bani yì Kǝrǝsti, sǝ wu pa ɓamur wun aban Ɓakuli, mǝnana loasǝi a ɓembe, sǝ pè wi nggea gulo ka; ace mani ka paɓamuru ma'wun, andǝ tsǝkɓalǝu ma'wun ngga, à kwakina amur Ɓakuli.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Mǝno ado wu langŋǝna rǝ wun nǝ okiru ma'wun arǝ mǝsǝcau, sǝ wu ndanǝ earcearǝu arǝ amǝ'eamrǝarǝu nǝ ɓabum wun mwashat ka, wu lidǝmba nǝ lǝmdǝ mǝno yì earcearǝu ka, nǝ ɓabum mǝɓoarnsari. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wun ngga, à ɓǝsǝlǝna ɓǝl wun a bǝshe aɓa kum yilǝmu mana pà nǝ̀ kìdìkì raka. Mǝnia yì bǝsa yilǝmu ka masǝlǝate pà kàm ɗàng acemǝnana pur aɓa mǝsǝɓeale mala cau mǝyilǝmuì mala Ɓakuli, yì cau male mana tè malkiyi raka.</char></note>Wun ngga, à ɓǝsǝlǝna ɓǝl wun a bǝshe, sǝ mǝnia yì bǝsa ɓǝlban ngga, pur aɓa mǝsǝɓeale mǝnana kǝ kìɗìkì ka ɗàng, pur aɓa mǝsǝɓeale mala cau mǝyilǝmuì mala Ɓakuli, yì cau male mana tè malkiyi raka. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Amur mǝnia ka, à gilǝ ama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Ɓwapǝndǝa kat ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">à nda kǝla bondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">aɓoarɓwa malea kat ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">à nda kǝla apwasǝo-bondo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">bondo kǝ wuli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">sǝ pwasǝe kǝ kpa,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />sǝ cau mala Mǝtalabangŋo ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:25">masǝlǝate pà kàm ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isha 40:6-8</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Sǝ mǝnia yì cau ka, nda Cau Amsǝban mǝnana à hamba wunì ka.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Ace mani ka, wu swár koya ulang ɓealɓikea, andǝ ɓosǝkiban, andǝ kúnɓárína, andǝ mwararǝu, andǝ koya ulang naki acau kiɗiki ɓwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Wu pa kǝla abangna-muna, rǝ wun ɓǝ̀ kǝ ɓǝla arǝ nu kiura mǝɓoarnsari mala cau mala Ɓakuli, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu gulo aɓalǝi, ɓǝ̀ kyan nǝ wun a amsǝban, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />mǝnana ado &lt;&lt;wu ongŋǝna ɓoaro mala Mǝtalabangŋo ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Ang 34:8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tali mǝyilǝmuì andǝ aɓwana <optbreak /> mǝnana Ɓakuli twalia ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Wu yiu a ban Kǝrǝsti, yì tali mǝyilǝmuì, mǝnana aɓwana ginǝki, sǝ Ɓakuli twali acemǝnana a baní ka ndanǝ ɓoaro ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ang 118:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isha 28:16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Sǝ wun ado ka wu nda ka tali mǝyilǝmuì, mǝnana Ɓakuli nda arǝ ɓak ɓala male aɓa bangŋo nǝ wun ngga. Aɓa mǝnia yì ɓala ka, wun nǝ̀ duk apǝris mala Ɓakuli ace pà aɓoro mala bangŋo, mǝnana agir'a na a baní, nǝ bu Yesu Kǝrǝsti ka. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Aɓa Malǝmce ka à gilǝa ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;Wu sǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ndya ǝn nggǝ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">tsǝk tali a Siyona ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">tali kwakita kusǝɓa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">mǝnana ǝn tarì,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">sǝ ɓoaro male ka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">à pà nǝ̀ kani arǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">kǝgìr raka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Ɓwa mǝnana kat gūlì</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">arǝì ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">pà nǝ̀ kum kǝsǝkya ɗang.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ang 118:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isha 28:16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Sǝ wun mana wu gūlì arǝì ka, ɓoaro male a ban wun ngga ulangni pà kàm ɗàng. Sǝ a ban aɓwana mǝnana à earnǝi raka dumǝna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;&lt;Tali mǝnana amǝɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ginǝki ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">nda yi duk Tali kwakita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">kusǝɓa ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ang 118:22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Sǝ ɗǝm ngga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;Nda tali mǝnana kǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">tsǝk ɓwapǝndǝa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">à kǝ anndǝ ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">tali mǝnana kǝ cia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">à kǝ kpa ka.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Isha 8:14</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">À kǝ annda, acemǝnana à kpata cau mala Ɓakuli ɗang, sǝ mǝnia ka, nda gìr mǝnana Ɓakuli tsǝkia wia ka.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Sǝ wun ngga, wu nda ka ɓwamǝpǝndǝe mǝnana Ɓakuli tàr wun ngga. Wu nda ka amurǝma pǝris, aɓwana ace Ɓakuli, andǝ agirkuma male. Tàr wun ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu hambi aɓwana aɓealɓoarna male, yi mǝnana tunǝ wun aɓa pǝndǝa aban yiu aɓa tǎlaban male mǝ pà ndali ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Pur 19:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Isha 43:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 4:20">Pǝris 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isha 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:21">Isha 43:21</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />&lt;&lt;Ɗiɗyal ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:10">wu nda ka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:10">kǝ aɓwana ɗàng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:10">sǝ adyan ngga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:10">wu dumǝna aɓwana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:10">mala Ɓakuli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:10">Ɗiɗyal ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:10">à sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:10">ma'wun ɗàng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:10">sǝ adyan ngga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:10">à sǝnǝna mǝsǝswatǝr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:10">ma'wun.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Wun amǝ'eamrǝarǝu mǝnana ǝn earkiyi acea raka, wun mǝnana wu nda ka amǝgya-kutio andǝ abǝri a ɓanza ka, ǝn nggǝ kwarkir wun, wu gapita re wun nǝ anpel mala nggūrǝu, mǝnana à kǝ munǝo arǝ yilǝmi wun ngga. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Do ma'wun aɓalǝ aɓwana mǝnana amǝkwaɗi na raka ɓǝ̀ dum nǝ ɓealɓoarna. Anggo ka ko ɓǝà tsǝka wun cau arǝ wun ama wu nda ka amǝ'ɓealɓikea ka, à nǝ̀ sǝn atúró mǝɓoarne mǝnana wu pakki ka, sǝ à nǝ̀ pè Ɓakuli gulo a pwari mǝnana nǝ̀ yiu a lǝmdǝ rǝì ka.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyesǝmuru aɓata aɓwana <optbreak /> mana a buno-gulo ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Ace Mǝtalabangŋo ka, wu pà ɓamur rǝ wun aɓata aɓwana mǝnana à nda amur buno-murǝm aɓa mǝnia yì ɓanza ka. Wu pà ɓamur rǝ wun a ban mǝtala-nzali kǝla ɓwa mǝnana nda a múr aɓwana kat ka. <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />Wu okî amǝ'yálban mǝnana à twalia sǝ à tasǝia ace kwarkir amǝ yàl nzongcau, sǝ ɓǝà ɓwangsǝ aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ pak mǝɓoarne ka. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ɓakuli ka, kàne male na ama nǝ́ pakki atúró cauɓoarna ma'wun ngga, ɓǝ̀ wu gìr kun amǝ'ɗwanyi-sǝlǝe arǝ nakia acau mǝɓane. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Wu dukdo kǝla aɓwana mǝnana à panzǝnia à kumǝna ɓamuria ka, sǝ ce wu pǝlǝ panzǝban ma'wun, dupa wun njargula pakki aɓealɓikea ɗang; ɓǝ̀ do ma'wun pa kǝla aguro mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Wu pè koyana le ka gulo, sǝ wu earce amǝ'eamrǝarǝu. Wu kǝ ɓanggi Ɓakuli, sǝ wu kǝ pe murǝm gulo.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Twal kusǝu arǝ tanni mala Kǝrǝsti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Wun mǝnana wu nda ka amuna-ɓala ka, wu kǝ oki amǝtala-ɓala ma'wun nǝ pagulo. Ɓǝ̀ kǝa do ama, she ɓǝà nda ka aɓwana mǝnana à kǝ pakka wun mǝɓoarne sǝ à nda ɓukɓuk ka ɗàng; nggearǝ amǝnana ɓealia ɓiki ka, wu kǝ okia wia. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ɓakuli ka, bumi kǝ pwasǝa rǝ wun, ɓǝ̀ wu pàk gìr mǝnana wu sǝlǝ ama mǝɓoarne na, sǝ wu kǝ shakminǝu nǝ munyi aɓa mǝɓane mǝnana kǝ kum wun atà pěmǝɓoarne ka. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ya gìr mǝɓoarne nda wun nǝ̀ kùmô aɓalǝi yi mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu twal gandǝa nǝ walban mana wu kùmô ace mǝɓane mǝnana wu pàk ka? Sǝa ma ɓǝ̀ wu kum tanni ace pak mǝɓoarne, sǝ wu twal gandǝa nǝi ka, bum Ɓakuli nǝ̀ pwasǝa rǝ wun. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Nda àkǝ̀ ce mǝnia ka sǝ Ɓakuli tunǝ wun, acemǝnana Kǝrǝsti gbal ka, nu tanni ace wun sǝ nyingga wuni kǝla gìrkànì, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu twalkusǝì ka.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Yì ka, pàk kǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">cauɓikea ɗang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:22">sǝ swarkiban pa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">a kúni ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isha 53:9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Lang aɓwana sanggì ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">nyesǝî kǝɓwa nǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">sangban ɗang;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:23">sǝ lang à pè wi tanni ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">ɓalbura kǝ ɓwa ama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">nǝ̀ ɗì tangna a kúnì</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:23">mǝnana à pakki wi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">ka ɗàng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:23">Tanni male ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">nyinggi Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">mǝnana kǝ pak ɓashi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:23">nǝ mǝsǝcau ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">a buì.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isha 53:7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Yì nǝ nggearǝì ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:24">twal acauɓikea ma'sǝm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:24">a nggūrǝì amur nggun-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:24">gangndǝi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:24">ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:24">wuki cauɓikea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:24">sǝ ɓǝ̀ sǝm dukdo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:24">ɓealɓoarna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:24">Nǝ́ anpenye male</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:24">mana à tsǝki wi ka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:24">sǝ wu kum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:24">twalban rǝkwana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isha 53:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:6">6</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ɗiɗyal ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:25">wu nda kǝla anzur</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:25">mǝnana à ɓwarki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:25">tanjar ka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:25">Sǝ ado ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:25">wu nyarǝna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:25">aban Yál wun andǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:25">Mǝtsǝkir ayilǝmi wun.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Amā-ɓala andǝ aburria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Anggo gbal, wun amā-ɓala ka, wu pà ɓamur rǝ wun aɓata abura wun, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ aɓea ɓwana ndakam ateà mǝnana à earnǝ Cau Amsǝban raka, ɓeal wun nǝ nunnia à nǝ̀ pà ɓamuria. Pà nǝ̀ do ama she ɓǝ̀ wu naná kǝ cau ka ɗàng,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Afi 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />acemǝnana à nǝ̀ sǝn pagulo, andǝ ɓealu mǝɓoarne ma'wun. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Ɓǝ̀ gilǝki rǝǔ ma'wun, ɓǝ̀ kǝa duk mala pakki agir arǝ nggūrǝ wun, kǝla aɓolǝkia-nyaun, andǝ oasǝki anlang, andǝ agirgarabu, ko mala agir-nggūrǝu mǝnana wu kǝ oasǝ ka ɗàng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1Tim 2:9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Gilǝki rǝǔ ma'wun ngga, ɓǝ̀ duk mala ɓabum wun, yì ɓoarnsari mǝnana pà nǝ̀ mal raka, yì ɓoarnsari mala ɓealu ɓukɓuka, andǝ do bwalrǝu arǝ aloasǝkiaban. Ulang mǝnia yì ɓealu ka, nggea gìr mǝgule na aban Ɓakuli. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Amamǝna mǝnana a pwarian à dukdo yál ɓamuria ace Ɓakuli sǝ à gūlì arǝì ka, anggo sǝ à gilǝki ɓoarnsari malea. À nongsǝmúrià aɓata aburria, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />kǝla mǝnana Saratu okî burí Ibǝrayim, sǝ tunǝi ama mǝtale ka. Wu nda ka amuni, ɓǝ̀ wu kǝ pak gìr mǝnana nda pepè sǝ ɓangciu kǝ pakka wun arǝ kǝgìr raka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Tite 18:12</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Anggo gbal, sǝ wun aburala ka, wu lǝmdǝ sǝlǝe aɓa doɓala ma'wun. Amālá wun ngga wu kǝ ɗenyi nǝia kǝla aɓwana mana rǝcandǝa malea bwalta ma'wun raka, sǝ wu bwalia nǝ pagulo acemǝnana yià ka, aɓiwun na aɓa ɓwamuru mala bǝsa do mana Ɓakuli pà ka. Wu bwalia pepè, ace mǝnana kǝgìr ɓǝ̀ kǝa tamsǝ ahiwi ma'wun raka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Afi 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanni ace pàk mǝɓoarne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />A masǝlǝate ka, wun kat ka, ɗenyicau ma'wun ɓǝ̀ duk mwashat. Wu kǝ sǝn mǝsǝswatǝr mala rǝarǝ wun. Wu earce rǝarǝ wun kǝla amǝ'eamrǝarǝu. Wu dum nǝ ɓabum ɓuɓɓuka andǝ nyesǝmuru. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Wu kǝa wu mbweban nǝ ɓealɓikea a kun ɓealɓikea ɗang. Ɓǝ̀ aɓwana sanggi wun ngga, ce wu nyesǝia wia nǝ sanggiban ɗang; a kun mani ka wu tsǝkia wia bu, acemǝnana nda àkǝ̀ ce mani sǝ Ɓakuli tunǝ wun, ama ɓǝ̀ wu kum tsǝkbu. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Malǝmce ka, bang ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">&lt;&lt;Ɓwa mǝnana kat kǝ earce</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">kum banɓoarnado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">mala yilǝmu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">sǝ nǝ̀ sǝn anonggio mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">bumpwasǝa ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">dumǝna púp nǝ̀ bwal lasǝi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">arǝ na mǝɓike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">sǝ mburkuni ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">nǝ̀ yállí arǝ na nyir.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Dumǝna púp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">nǝ̀ pǝlǝ nzǝmi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">arǝ ɓealɓikea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">sǝ nǝ̀ pàk mǝɓoarne;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">dumǝna púp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">nǝ̀ alta dorǝpwala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">sǝ nǝ̀ ɓangŋa atè.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Amǝ́sǝ́ Mǝtalabangŋo ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">à nda arǝ aɓwana mana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">à kǝ pak mǝɓoarne ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">sǝ akiri gbal ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">à ndarǝ ok hiwi malea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Sǝ ɓamǝsǝ Mǝtalabangŋo ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">kǝ ɓinǝmǝsǝ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">amǝpak ɓealɓikea.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Ang 34:12-16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Yana ɓwe na nǝ̀ pakka wun kǝgìr, yi mǝnana rǝ wun nǝ̀ nggǝ ɓǝla arǝ pak gìr mǝɓoarne ka? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Sǝ ko ɓǝ̀ wu kum tanni ace pak gìr mǝnana nda a njarnì ka, wu ndanǝ tsǝkbu mala Ɓakuli. Ace mani ka, &lt;&lt;bum wun ɓǝ̀ kǝa zurǝki ɗàng, sǝ ɓangciu ɓǝ̀ kǝa pakka wun ɗàng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">Isha 8:12</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 8:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5:10</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Wun ngga, wu kǝ pe Kǝrǝsti gulo a ɓabum wun, ɓǝ̀ duk Mǝtala wun. Wu do aɓa gilǝrǝu ko aya pwari ka, ace bǝ́lì koya ɓwa na ɗì wun ce tǝ́r tsǝkɓalǝu mǝnana wu ndanǝi aɓa kwaɗi ma'wun ngga. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Sǝa ma wu pè nǝ ɓukɓuka, andǝ pagulo aɓalǝi. Ɓǝ̀ ɗenyicau ɓabum wun do nǝ ɓoarnsari, ace mǝnana ko ɓǝà ɓwana kiɗiki wun nǝ kunia ka, kǝsǝkya nǝ̀ pakkia wia, yi mǝnana ɓǝà sǝn do ma'wun mǝɓoarnsari, acemǝnana wu nda ka mala Kǝrǝsti ka. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Nǝ̀ ɓoaribanì ɓǝ̀ ɓwa tanni ace pak gìr mǝɓoarne, ɓǝ̀ mǝno nda eare mala Ɓakuli ka, amur mǝnana ɓwa ɓǝ̀ tanni ace ɓealɓikea ka! <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kǝrǝsti ka, wú ace acauɓikea ma'sǝm kusǝ mwashat ɓǝ̀rɓǝ̀r, mǝ'cauɓoarna ace amǝ'cauɓikea, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ yinǝ wun a ɓala aban Ɓakuli ka. Yì ka, wú aɓa nggūrǝu, sǝama dum nǝ yilǝmu aɓa bangŋo. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Sǝ aɓa pa male anggo aɓa bangŋo ka wario kya hama aban abangŋo mǝnana à nda kùrban ngga. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Amǝnia ka, à nda ka abangŋo mǝnana à mgbikî Ɓakuli kiru a pwarian a nza mala Nuhu, a bàkú mǝnana Nuhu nda aban shar nggea waru male, sǝ Ɓakuli nda arǝ kúndǝô nǝ́ munyi ka. Kǝ aɓwana tongno-nong-tàrú nda à amsǝia amǝno yì nggea mùr-gùla ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Tite 6:1--7:24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Sǝ mǝno yì mùr-gùla, mǝnana aɓwana tongno-nong-tàrú apî wi ka, nda kǝla batisǝma mǝnana kǝ amsǝ wun ado ka. Pà ace lak pǝndǝkea mala nggūrǝu wun ɗàng, nda ace lǝmdǝ eare ma'wun a ban Ɓakuli nǝ ɓabum mǝɓoarnsari. Kǝ amsǝ wun acemǝnana Yesu Kǝrǝsti lo a ɓembe nǝ yilǝmu ka. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ado ka, Kǝrǝsti umǝna a kùli, nda a bù-mǝlì mala Ɓakuli, sǝ amǝturonjar, andǝ ayálban, andǝ arǝcandǝa kat ka, à nda a ɓate.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Do ace Ɓakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Sǝ acemǝnana Kǝrǝsti nu tanni aɓa nggūrǝu ka, wu twal ulang mǝno yì ɓealu ka, wu gilǝ rǝwun ace tanni kǝla male; acemǝnana ɓwa mana kat tanni a nggūrǝu ka, malǝna nǝ cauɓikea. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Twal ado ka, cili do yilǝmu male a ɓanza ka pà nǝ̀ duk mala ɓangŋa atà anpel mala nggūrǝu ɗǝm ɗàng. Nǝ̀ dukdo mala lùmsǝ kani mala Ɓakuli. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Apwari mǝnana à kutikina ka, à kārǝ́na mala pakkia agir mǝnana amǝɓanza earkiyice pe ka, kǝla ɓiki do-kiɗìkì mala nongginǝ-rǝarǝu, andǝ npel, andǝ nukia agir aban wal-wale, andǝ dapi ace likiali-ɓana andǝ nongginǝ-rǝarǝu, andǝ akpapíkí mala nu mba andǝ loàsǝ̀ban, andǝ atúró mǝɓike mala peri aban ankúl. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ado ka, agyajam ma'wun mǝnana ɗiɗyal ka, à kǝ ndali acemǝnana wu kǝ kpapi wunǝia ɗǝm aɓa mǝno yì do-kiɗìkì andǝ ɗwanyi bwalrǝu ka ɗàng. Nda gir nî sǝ à kǝ sanggi wun, <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />sǝ yia ka, à nǝ̀ nggá bǝl kunia aban Ɓakuli mǝnana angŋa dǝmba gilǝna rǝì ace pakki aɓwana mǝnana nǝ yilǝmu andǝ alú ka ɓashi. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Nda gìr mǝnana tsǝa sǝ à hamnǝ Bǝsa Cau Mǝɓoarne gbal aban aɓwana mǝnana à wuna ado ka, ace mǝnana yia ka, ɓǝà ɓashia wia kǝla aɓwapǝndǝa aɓa nggūrǝu, sǝ ɓǝà dum nǝ yilǝmu aɓa bangŋo aban Ɓakuli.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Masǝlǝata ɓanza ka, gbàshìnà. Ace mani ka, wu shambum wun, nǝ gandǝrǝu ace pak hiwi. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />A dǝmba nǝ koya gìr ka, wu lidǝmba nǝ lǝmdǝià rǝ wun earcearǝu mǝlime, acemǝnana earcearǝu ka, kǝ gír múr acauɓikea pas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Pas 10:12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Wu ak rǝarǝ wun arǝ aɓala ma'wun, nggwani ɓǝ̀ kǝa pàk kàm ɗàng. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Ɓakuli panì koyan ngga ɓoro mala sǝlǝ pak ɓè kǝgìr. Acemani ka, koyan ngga ɓǝ̀ paktúró nǝ male yi ɓoro ace pakkia acilia ɓwana gbasha, ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ sǝm duk aɓwana mǝnana Ɓakuli earnǝia arǝ tsǝkir aɓoro male mǝnana à ndakam ɗàngɗáng ngga. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ɓǝ̀ we ka, sǝlǝ nacau nda à po ka, ne kǝla Ɓakuli nda nakiyi cau nǝ kuno ka. Ɓǝ̀ mò yi ɓoro ka ndà pea aɓwana gbasha ka, pè nǝ rǝcandǝa andǝ rǝɓǝla mǝnana Ɓakuli po ka. Anggo ka, gìr mǝnana kat a pe ka, nǝ̀ yinǝi Ɓakuli gulo nǝban Yesu Kǝrǝsti. Gulo andǝ rǝcandǝa kat ka amale na, málá male pà kàm ɗàng! Ɓǝ̀ do anggo.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Do munyi aɓa tanni acemǝnana <optbreak /> a nda mǝkwaɗi ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Wun amǝ'eambǝam, wu kǝa ndali arǝ akārǝkiban mǝkwane mǝnana wu kǝ tanni aɓalǝia, kǝla ɓè kǝgìr mǝbǝshe na kǝ kum wun ngga ɗàng. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />A kun mani ka, ɓǝ̀ ban ɓoara wun ama wu ndarǝ nu tanni arǝ agir mǝ'mwashati mǝnana Kǝrǝsti twal gandǝa nǝia ka. Wu pak bumpwasǝa ado ace mǝnana ɓǝ̀ wu kum banɓoarnado mǝgule a pwari mǝnana nǝ̀ nyar nǝi sǝ nǝ̀ lǝmdǝ ɓoarɓwa male ka. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Ɓǝ̀ aɓwana kǝ sáng wun acemǝnana wu nda ka amǝkpata Kǝrǝsti ka, tsǝkbu na amur wun, acemǝnana Bangŋo mala gulo andǝ mala Ɓakuli sulǝna amur wun. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa nǝ̀ tanni atà wun ngga, ɓǝ̀ kǝa do ama nda ace wal-lú, ko iun'í, ko altacau, ko oasǝkikun aɓalǝ acau mala aɓwana ɗàng. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ɓǝ̀ ɓwa nu tanni acemǝnana yì ka, mala Kǝrǝsti na ka, gìr kǝsǝkya na ɗang. Ɓwangsǝ Ɓakuli, acemǝnana à kǝ tunǝo nǝ lullǝì ka. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Pwari mala ɓashi kārǝ́na, sǝ ndo nǝ̀ tite nǝ ɓáɓala mala Ɓakuli; sǝ ɓǝ̀ ɓashi tite arǝ sǝm ngga, lang sǝ masǝlǝate nǝ̀ pangnǝ aɓwana mǝnana à mgbikiru nǝ Bǝsa Cau Amsǝban mala Ɓakuli ka? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Ɗǝm ngga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;Ɓǝ̀ nda bǝti sǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">amǝ'ɓealɓoarna nǝ̀ au ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">mana nǝ̀ kum amǝ'ɗwanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">kpata Ɓakuli andǝ aɓwana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">mǝnana amǝ'cauɓikea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">na ka?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Pas 11:31</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Ace mani ka, ɓǝ̀ wu nda ban tanni aɓa kàné mala Ɓakuli ka, wu lidǝmba aɓa pak gìr mǝnana nda a nzongnì ka, sǝ wu nying ayilǝmi wun a ɓabù Ɓakuli mǝnana pusǝ wun ngga, acemǝnana yì ka, pà nǝ̀ pà wun kǝsǝkya ɗang.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Akwarkiru ace aɓwana-mǝgule <optbreak /> andǝ alo-aɓwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Mǝ nda rǝ ɓakɓabum aɓwana-mǝgule mǝnana aɓalǝ wun ngga kǝla ɓi'wun ɓwamǝgule. Ən sǝn nutanni mala Kǝrǝsti nǝ amǝsǝam, sǝ mim gbal ka, mǝ nǝ kum kāmbe mem aɓa ɓoarɓwa male, yi mǝnana ɓǝ̀ yi pusǝna rǝì aban ɓanza ka. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Wu yál domwan mala Ɓakuli mǝnana tsǝk wun a yalè ka. Wu tsǝk mǝsǝ wun arǝì nǝ eare ma'wun, kǝla mǝnana Ɓakuli earce ka, pà kǝla à tsǝk wun púp ɗang. Wu pak turè sǝ wu kǝa tsǝk ɓalǝ wun arǝ gir mǝnana wun nǝ̀ kùmô aɓalǝi ka ɗàng, wu pè acemǝnana wu ndanǝ rǝɓǝla mala pakki Ɓakuli túró ka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Yoh 21:15-17</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Aɓwana mǝnana à tsǝk wun amúrià ama wu ɗenyi nǝia ka, wu kǝa lǝmdǝia wia rǝcandǝa ɗàng, wu duk girkànì a bania. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Sǝ ɓǝ̀ Gbani mala ayálgír yi pusǝna rǝì ka, wun nǝ̀ kum mbulan-gulo mǝɓoarne mǝnana pà nǝ̀ è raka.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Sǝ wun alo-ɓwa gbal ka, wu kǝ nongsǝ mur wun aɓata aɓwana-mǝgule. Wun kat ka, wu do nǝ nyesǝmuru a rǝarǝ wun, acemǝnana Malǝmce na ama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">&lt;&lt;Ɓakuli kǝ mgbàllì</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">amǝ'gusǝlǝ-múrû,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">sǝ kǝ lǝmdǝì amǝ nyesǝmúrû ɓwamuru.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Pas 3:34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ace mani ka, wu nyesǝ múr wun aɓata rǝcandǝa mǝgule mala Ɓakuli, sǝ ɓǝ̀ pwari male karǝ ka, nǝ̀ loasǝ wun a kùli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk 18:14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Gìr mǝnana kat kǝ pisǝ bum wun ngga, wu nyinggi Ɓakuli a buì, acemǝnana yì ka, kǝ ɗenyi nǝ wun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gìr mǝnana kat kǝ pisǝ bum wun ngga, wu nyinggi Ɓakuli a buì, acemǝnana yì ka, kǝ ɗenyi nǝ wun </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ko &lt;&lt;Wu soapi wi atanni ma'wun amurí acemǝnana yì ka kǝ ɗenyi nǝ wun.&gt;&gt;</char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Wu hami rǝ wun, sǝ wu tsǝkir wun. Ɓi wun mǝbura, yi Mgbǝrǝm ngga, nda rǝ gāliki arǝ aban kǝla im mǝnana nzala kǝ wali ka, aban alta ɓwa mǝnana nǝ̀ bwal ka. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Wu tamsǝ kusǝ wun kàngkàng aɓa paɓamuru ma'wun, wu ɓinǝi wi. Wu sǝlǝ ama aɓi wun amǝkwaɗi aɓa ɓanza kat ka, à nda ban nu ulang tanni ma'wun.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ɓakuli ka nda mǝtala ɓwamuru kat. Yì nda mana tunǝ wun aɓa gulo male mǝnana málá male pà kàm raka, aɓa Kǝrǝsti Yesu. Anzǝm mǝnana wu nùnà tanni aɓalǝ apwari bǝti ka, yì nǝ nggearǝì nǝ̀ nyesǝ wun a ban came mǝɓoarne, nǝ̀ pà wun gbasha, andǝ rǝcandǝa. Ɗǝm ngga nǝ̀ dumsǝ wun aɓa lidǝmba mana pà wu nǝ̀ dǝurǝ raka. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Rǝcandǝa kat ka, a baní sǝ pa, málá male pà kàm ɗàng. Ɓǝ̀ do anggo.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masǝlǝata makkun mala Bitǝrus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Nǝ́ bu Silas mǝnana ǝn earnǝi kǝla mǝ'eamrǝarǝu mǝ'mǝsǝcau nì ka, sǝ ǝn nggǝ gilǝa wun mǝnia yì cau gbǝlǝm ngga. Ən nggǝ earce mǝ ɓak ɓabum wun, sǝ mǝ na wun ama, mǝnia yì gir wu nda ɓālǝi ado ka, ɓwamuru mala Ɓakuli na kat ace wun. Wu cam kàngkàng aɓalǝi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Atúró 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Ikǝlisiya kani a Babila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Babila: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝnia ka, lullǝu sǝmbǝrǝa na ace nggea-là Roma.</char></note>, mǝnana Ɓakuli tár wun wunǝia ɓǝ̀ wu duk amale ka, kǝ makka wun kún. Sǝ munem, yì Markus ka, kǝ makka wun kún gbal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓalli gbal aɓa: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Atúró 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film 24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Wu makkia rǝ wun kún nǝ earcearǝu mala amǝkwaɗi. Ɓǝ̀ rǝpwala do atà wun kat, wun aɓwana mǝnana wu nda aɓa Kǝrǝsti ka.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>